[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10441.74, "timestamp": "02:54:01", "text": "只需填补球队空缺即可。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10443.99, "timestamp": "02:54:03", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10447.03, "timestamp": "02:54:07", "text": "你喜欢哪些角色？我喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10449.469, "timestamp": "02:54:09", "text": "氖。我的意思是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10452.55, "timestamp": "02:54:12", "text": "霓虹灯，因为它提醒我这款游戏是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10454.469, "timestamp": "02:54:14", "text": "速度不算太慢，而且感觉它能做到……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10462.469, "timestamp": "02:54:22", "text": "这就是为什么我玩得比较慢的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10464.229, "timestamp": "02:54:24", "text": "有时。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10467.99, "timestamp": "02:54:27", "text": "这就是我喜欢霓虹灯的原因。这样我就可以跑了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10478.309, "timestamp": "02:54:38", "text": "唉，我希望像那种竞争的方面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10480.309, "timestamp": "02:54:40", "text": "也会是快节奏的，因为就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10482.15, "timestamp": "02:54:42", "text": "以前我们参加比赛的时候，比如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10484.55, "timestamp": "02:54:44", "text": "我们必须喜欢它，就像总是最后一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10486.469, "timestamp": "02:54:46", "text": "就像过去20秒那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10488.469, "timestamp": "02:54:48", "text": "那时一切都会发生，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10490.71, "timestamp": "02:54:50", "text": "因为在那之前通常是这样的：哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10493.349, "timestamp": "02:54:53", "text": "我们喜欢尝试侦察中路或者像我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10495.189, "timestamp": "02:54:55", "text": "弄清楚人们在哪里，我们进行核查"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10497.91, "timestamp": "02:54:57", "text": "网站，然后我们就到了最后20个。"}]